{"ts": "2026-09-28T23:12:23Z", "headline": "Main strategy is up $3,378 on 2 of 2 winning bets, but only 18 markets have resolved, so nothing is established yet; the market price is still our best forecaster overall.", "went_well": ["Main (Jev + Claude research) won both settled bets and is up $3,377.58. Two bets is luck-sized, not proof.", "Claude direct scored a Brier of 0.097 against the market's 0.112, but it was judged on only 8 markets, possibly not the same ones.", "Jev + research scored a Brier of 0.119 on 10 markets, far better than Jev alone at 0.336 on 18, so the research step looks like it matters."], "went_badly": ["We are not beating the market: it scored 0.112 on all 18 resolved markets, and Jev + research (0.119, n=10) did not clearly beat it. In crypto (6 markets) the market scored 0.055 against research's 0.130.", "Jev alone scored a Brier of 0.336 on 18 markets. That is worse than answering 50% every time (0.25), and it was worst in sports at 0.408 (n=9).", "Of this week's reviewed outcomes, 2 misses were overconfidence and 2 of the 3 wins were judged lucky. The bold strategy is 1 for 3 with 25 bets still open, and the self-calibrating strategy can't start until 30 resolved markets exist (it has 10)."], "proposals": [], "numbers": {"since": "2026-09-21T23:12:23Z", "now": "2026-09-28T23:12:23Z", "strategies": [{"name": "main", "label": "Jev + Claude research", "probability": "jev_research", "gates": "jev_research", "gate_overrides": {}, "equity": 103377.58, "realized": 3377.58, "open": 4, "settled": 2, "wins": 2}, {"name": "jev_alone", "label": "Jev alone", "probability": "jev_plain", "gates": "jev_plain", "gate_overrides": {}, "equity": 100000.0, "realized": 0, "open": 1, "settled": 0, "wins": 0}, {"name": "claude_direct", "label": "Claude direct", "probability": "claude_direct", "gates": "jev_research", "gate_overrides": {}, "equity": 100000.0, "realized": 0, "open": 3, "settled": 0, "wins": 0}, {"name": "bold", "label": "Jev + research, bold", "p