{"ts": "2026-09-30T23:35:30Z", "headline": "A losing day for most strategies. Only main is ahead, at +$483 on 8 settled bets. Every Jev forecast still scores worse than the market price, and every sample here is too small to call.", "went_well": ["Main is up $483 on 8 settled bets (4 wins, 4 losses). On the yardstick, main made +$1,173 and original +$1,136 on the same 11 bets, but only 4 have settled, so that is a tie and says nothing yet about the crypto skip.", "The info gate appears to be saving money. Markets it stopped for main would have lost $44 per $100 staked (37 markets), and for Jev alone $60 per $100 (58 markets).", "Claude direct's forecasts score a Brier of 0.131 (33 resolved), against 0.135 for the market price (120 resolved). The two are not scored on the same markets, so this is a hint, not proof, that Claude matches the market."], "went_badly": ["Claude direct has lost all 4 of its settled bets, for -$8,000, despite having the best Brier score. Four bets is noise, but it suggests the gaps it bets on are its own errors rather than real edge.", "Bold is down $8,545 all time (4 wins, 10 losses) and has lost all 3 bets settled since its info threshold rose to 0.35 (-$5,424). Jev alone, bold, is down $7,552 with 1 win in 6.", "We are not beating the market. By Brier score, the market is at 0.135, Jev + research at 0.199 (82 resolved), Jev alone at 0.266 (120) and self-calibrating Jev at 0.236 (22). Calibration seems to make Jev worse. In economy, Jev + research scores 0.337 against the market's 0.168 (11 resolved)."], "proposals": ["p5", "ch6", "p7"], "numbers": {"since": "2026-09-29T23:35:30Z", "now": "2026-09-30T23:35:30Z", "period_days": 1, "strategies": [{"name": "main", "label": "Jev + Claude research", "probability": "jev_research", "gates": "jev_research", "challenger": false, "frozen": false, "rules": {"min_edge": 0.08, "min_rules_clear": 0.75, "min_info_sufficient": 0.5, "max_framing_gap": 0.15, "kelly_fraction": 0.25, "max_stake_pct": 0.02, "m